 n\nBasically CyCognito:\n\n\n  *   Accurately discovers all your known a
 nd unknown assets\n  *   Automatically classifies and categorizes like a
 n external CMDB\n  *   Conducts passive red team emulation / continuous 
 pentesting to determine if ‘soft spots’ or risk prone areas\n  *   Integ
 rates the outputs back to vulnerability management to operationalize the
  remediation of vulnerabilities\n\n\n________________________________\nC
 yCognito (www.cycognito.com<https://linkprotect.cudasvc.com/url?a=http%3
 a%2f%2fwww.cycognito.com&c=E\,1\,aBGKE7-N2a55xXPf2tALSGq4mH7cOCe76HfA1Ef
