 A&typo=1>) uses automated reconnaissance and attack-emulations to scan\,
  discover\, and fingerprint billions of digital assets without any confi
 guration.\n\nThe platform uses advanced AI & ML to instantly and automat
 ically attribute assets that belong to you - accurately (for example\, r
 ogue workloads\, shadow IT assets\, dangling DNS\, public GitHubs\, and 
 much more)\n\nWith their proprietary vulnerability scanning and automate
 d pentest technoloqy\, they can then give you a clean and easy way to op
 erationalize vulnerability management / risk mitigation.\n\n\n
