CREATED:20200908T111122Z
DESCRIPTION:8:15 AM - 8:30 AM May 11\, 2009\nLocation: Mike's Bridge\n\n
 Guys\,\n\nWe need to talk about how fast we can actually get this projec
 t completed.\nThe client is being very difficult regarding payment terms
  and they seem to\nbe willing to move on to the second vendor and elimin
 ate NCX if we don't\naccept their terms.  Some negotiation\, take or lea
 ve it.  I would like to\nfind a away to do this project as they have 24 
 water agencies that they work\nwith.  A good reference with the other fr
 om them is going to be worth it's\nweight in gold.\n\nWe need to overwhe
 lm them\, exceed expectations and deliver on a time.  Let's\ntalk about 
 realistic expectations for this project.\n
