 semination\, distribution or copying of this communication is strictly p
 rohibited. If you received this communication in error\, please immediat
 ely notify us by telephone/fax and destroy the facsimile.\n\n\n\n\nOn Ja
 nuary 8\, 2020 at 10:36:41 AM\, Harish Ramani (hramani@helenoftroy.com<m
