 sday\, January 8\, 2020 9:32 AM\nTo: Harish Ramani <hramani@helenoftroy.
 com<mailto:hramani@helenoftroy.com>>\; Steve Drohan <sdrohan@ncxgroup.co
 m<mailto:sdrohan@ncxgroup.com>>\nSubject: Thank You and Introduction\n\n
 Hi Harish\,\n\nHappy New Year!\n\nI wanted to say thank you for your tru
 st with your cybersecurity project.  I wanted to introduce you to Steve 
