DESCRIPTION:I want to create a project to have LAN WAN E to build the We
 bsense Remote Filtering Server and configure the DMZ.\nHere are the part
 s of the Scope of Work:\n1) buy Server (suggest HP DL320 G5 rack mount)\
 n2) buy Server OS\n3) build server and install Websense Remote Filtering
 \n4) install Websense Remote Filtering Server and configure DMZ and PIX\
 n5) test with remote client pc\nI have been requested to arrange a confe
 rence call to discuss the Websense\, DMZ and PIX configs and to include 
 the security guys from NCX - I will also try to get technical support on
  Websense to participate in the conference call.\n\n
