DESCRIPTION:When: Thursday\, May 21\, 2020 2:00 PM-3:00 PM. (UTC-08:00) 
 Pacific Time (US & Canada)\nWhere: NCX Group Goto Meeting Link\n\n*~*~*~
 *~*~*~*~*~*~*\n\nGood Morning\,\n\nOn Thursday at 2:00 Billy Spazante fr
 om Seaport will holding a deep dive into IPK Command and Control Tech De
 ep Dive\nWhen: Thursday\, May 21\, 2020 at 2:00 PM - 3:00 PM in (UTC-08:
 00) Pacific Time (US & Canada).\nLocation: NCX Group Goto Meeting Linkth
 e Seaport Technology that NCX Group has a License to sell and develop ap
 plications with in the commercial space\, anything but Military and Gove
 rnment.  My hope is that with all of us on the call we will be able to g
 et all of our questions answered and by able to walk away and develop ou
 r own game plan regarding applications and targets we can we can approac
 h.  Given the current state of the world I think there is an massive opp
 ortunity here for all of us with this very unique and additive tech to e
 xisting standards based encryption.\n\nCurrent Potential Targets\n\nSoni
 cWALL\nArctic Wolf\nPalo Alto Networks\nFortinet\nUbiquiti Networks\n\n\
 nNCX Group Security\n\nPlease join my meeting from your computer\, table
 t or smartphone.\nhttps://www.gotomeet.me/ncxgroup\n\nYou can also dial 
 in using your phone.\nUnited States: +1 (646) 749-3122<tel:+16467493122\
 ,\,458535117>\n\nAccess Code: 458-535-117\n\nNew to GoToMeeting? Get the
  app now and be ready when your first meeting starts:\nhttps://global.go
 tomeeting.com/install/458535117\n\n\n\n
