 no.com";ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT:mailto:russell@gotekno.com
ATTENDEE;CN="sayed.olomi@hpcommunications.com";CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;EMAIL="
 sayed.olomi@hpcommunications.com";ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT:mailto:sayed.olom
 i@hpcommunications.com
CREATED:20200908T111000Z
DESCRIPTION:Here are the questions that we’ll need to get answered on th
 is call:\nA. Most likely disaster scenarios\, e.g.\, earthquake\, power 
 outage\, flooding\, theft of equipment\n\nB. Details on how the company 
 currently envisions dealing with a disaster scenario\n\nC. Names\, email
  addresses\, and phone numbers for members of the emergency team\, e.g.\
 , senior management\, selected subject matter experts\n\nD. Addresses of
  all locations that are to be included in the plan\n\nE. Key business ac
 tivities of the firm\n\nF. Systems that are used to support the firm's b
 usiness (locally hosted and remotely hosted)\n\nG. Network services used
  to support the business\n\nH. Network diagrams showing all locations co
 nnected by the company's network\n\nI. Diagrams of data center layouts a
 nd equipment configurations\n\nJ. Lists of key vendors\, with addresses\
 , key contact\, and phone numbers and email\n\nK. List of vital records 
 needed to run the business (other than those stored electronically)\n\nL
 . Details on data and system backup procedures\n\nM. Details on where da
 ta are stored\, e.g.\, on-site\, cloud\n\nN. Names and contact details o
 n who is responsible for speaking to the media in an emergency\n\nO. Nam
 es and contact details for banks used by the company\n\nP. Names and con
 tact details for law firms used by the company\n\nQ. Names and contact d
 etails on insurance firms used by the company\n\nIf it's possible to ans
 wer some/all of these questions in advance of the call\, that will be a 
 big help.\n\n
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20190805T130000
