BEGIN:VEVENT
CREATED:20200908T111156Z
DESCRIPTION:As a  result of the new Websense server being installed\, I 
 will be on site to install the Arcsight agent and configure the firewall
  changes needed.  I will also be sure to scan the new box for security r
 elated issues and make sure the box has been hardened.\n\nBrad – Would i
 t be possible for you to review the firewall configs and send me the nec
 essary changes that will be required to remove the current IP address fo
 r UWL2 and replace it with the new one --> 192.168.5.25\n\nHere’s the em
 ail we received from UWL.\n\n<\nSteve\,\n\nFYI:  Yesterday afternoon we 
 installed the new Websense Server (LAN side) and removed the old Websens
 e Server - that was UWL2 that you called to let me know that your monito
 ring detected that it had gone down.\n\n- I have forwarded to you the pr
 oposed networking modifications (PIX\, DMZ\, Server Setup) for the Webse
 nse Project.\n- LanWan Enterprises has built\, configured\, hardened the
  new LAN side server and installed it in place of the previous Websense 
 server (UWL2).\n- LanWan Enterprises has copied the Websense definitions
  and parameters onto the new server.\n- New Websense server IP is 192.16
 8.5.25 (do you need to install the monitoring client on it?)\n\n-irwin\n
 >\n
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20071106T200000
DTSTAMP:20250319T180208Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Denver:20071106T170000
LAST-MODIFIED:20220731T165304Z
LOCATION:UWL
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Install agent software / Firewall change
TRANSP:OPAQUE
