DESCRIPTION:Hi Lonnie\,\n\nChris Leffel and I look forward to meeting yo
 ur technical team and providing a technical overview and demo of TrueDLP
 .\n\nOur objective will be to show your team:\n\n  *   How TrueDLP is le
 veraged by a customer to ensure regulatory compliance and protect their 
 sensitive information.\n  *   How NCX Group can leverage TrueDLP to clas
 sify data and perform Risk Assessments.\n\n\nSince Healthcare is a stron
 g market for both NCX Group and CGN\, I will ask Chris to do the demo wi
 th a Healthcare focus as opposed to a “generic” demo. I think your team 
 will appreciate some of our advantages in Healthcare which can different
 iate your deliverables from that of your competitors.\n\n1.  Please join
  my meeting\, Jun 28\, 2012 at 4:00 PM PDT.\nhttps://www2.gotomeeting.co
 m/join/776074986\n\n2.  Use your microphone and speakers (VoIP) - a head
 set is recommended. Or\, call in using your telephone.\n\n\nUnited State
 s: +1 (786) 358-5410\nAccess Code: 776-074-986\nAudio PIN: Shown after j
 oining the meeting\n\nMeeting ID: 776-074-986\n\nGoToMeeting®\nOnline Me
 etings Made Easy™\nPat\n\n\n
