 an push it until you’re ready.\nOn Nov 1\, 2018\, 1:51 PM -0700\, Martin
 \, Ryan - ISD <ryan.martin@gdba.com<mailto:ryan.martin@gdba.com>>\, wrot
 e:\nI do\, thank you. I'm still working on reading though it \; so many 
