  morning around 10:30 or 11:00am if you are free and try to have my revi
 ew completed by then.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Steve Drohan 
 <sdrohan@ncxgroup.com<mailto:sdrohan@ncxgroup.com>>\nSent: Thursday\, No
 vember 1\, 2018 1:49 PM\nTo: Martin\, Ryan - ISD <ryan.martin@gdba.com<m
