DESCRIPTION:Updated. (again)\n\nHello \,\n\nDave Flournoy has invited yo
 u to join a meeting on the Web\,using WebEx.\n\nTOPIC: NetWitness Demo\n
 DATE: Friday\, November 2\, 2007\nTIME: 11:00 am\, Pacific Daylight Time
  (GMT -07:00\, San Francisco ) .\nMEETING NUMBER: 683 121 401\nPASSWORD:
  nwdemo\nTELECONFERENCE: toll free: 1-866-866-2244\ninternational: 1-404
 -260-1415\naccess code: 1403221\nPlease click the link below to see more
  information\, or to join the meeting.\n\nHere's what to do:\n1. At the 
 meeting's starting time\, either click the following link or copy and pa
 ste it into your Web browser:\nhttps://netwitness.webex.com/netwitness/j
 .php?ED=93014992&UID=54364777\n2. Enter your name\, your email address\,
  and the meeting password (if required)\, and then click Join.\n3. If th
 e meeting includes a teleconference\, follow the instructions that autom
 atically appear on your screen.\n\nThat's it! You're in the web meeting!
 \n\nWebEx will automatically setup Meeting Manager for Windows the first
  time you join a meeting. To save time\, you can setup prior to the meet
 ing by clicking this link:\nhttps://netwitness.webex.com/netwitness/meet
 ingcenter/mcsetup.php\n\nFor Help or Support:\nGo to https://netwitness.
 webex.com/netwitness/mc click Assistance\, then Click Help or click Supp
 ort.\n\nTo contact Dave Flournoy \, email: dave@netwitness.com\n\n\n\nTo
  add this meeting to your calendar program (for example Microsoft Outloo
 k)\, click this link:\nhttps://netwitness.webex.com/netwitness/j.php?ED=
 93014992&UID=54364777&ICS=MI\n\nThe host requests that you check for com
 patibility of rich media players for Universal Communications Format (UC
 F) before you join the session. UCF allows you to view multimedia during
  the session. To check now\, click the following link:\nhttps://netwitne
 ss.webex.com/netwitness/systemdiagnosis.php\n\nhttp://www.webex.com\nWe'
 ve got to start meeting like this(TM)\n\n\n\nThere has been a scheduling
  conflict on their end.  I’m moving this meeting to tomorrow.  If you ha
 ve a conflict let me know and I’ll move it to next week.\n\nThanks.\n\n\
 nGuys\,\nI’ve scheduled a tentative day for us to have a web demo of the
  NetWitness solution.  Let me know as soon as possible if this time does
 n’t work for you.\n\nBill\n
