DESCRIPTION:Hi there\,\n\nRyan Martin is inviting you to a scheduled Zoo
 m meeting.\n\nJoin from PC\, Mac\, Linux\, iOS or Android: https://GDBA.
 zoom.us/j/116712690?pwd=Cf4qdrCjbOw\n    Password: 13579\n\nOr an H.323/
 SIP room system:\n   H.323:\n        162.255.37.11 (US West)\n        16
 2.255.36.11 (US East)\n        221.122.88.195 (China)\n        115.114.1
 31.7 (India)\n        213.19.144.110 (EMEA)\n        202.177.207.158 (Au
 stralia)\n        209.9.211.110 (Hong Kong)\n        64.211.144.160 (Bra
 zil)\n        69.174.57.160 (Canada)\n    Meeting ID: 116 712 690\n    P
 assword: 214446\n\n    SIP: 116712690@zoomcrc.com<mailto:116712690@zoomc
 rc.com>\n    Password: 214446\n\n\n\n\n\n_______________________________
 ______________\nFrom: Steve Drohan <sdrohan@ncxgroup.com<mailto:sdrohan@
 ncxgroup.com>>\nSent: Thursday\, November 1\, 2018 1:53 PM\nTo: Martin\,
  Ryan - ISD <ryan.martin@gdba.com<mailto:ryan.martin@gdba.com>>\nSubject
 : RE: Follow-up\n\nSounds good … no pressure\, do you need more time?  I
  can do 10:30 if that works for you tomorrow\, or we can push it until y
 ou’re ready.\nOn Nov 1\, 2018\, 1:51 PM -0700\, Martin\, Ryan - ISD <rya
 n.martin@gdba.com<mailto:ryan.martin@gdba.com>>\, wrote:\nI do\, thank y
 ou. I'm still working on reading though it \; so many things have pulled
  me away this week it is crazy.\n\nI can talk tomorrow morning around 10
 :30 or 11:00am if you are free and try to have my review completed by th
 en.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Steve Drohan <sdrohan@ncxgroup.
 com<mailto:sdrohan@ncxgroup.com>>\nSent: Thursday\, November 1\, 2018 1:
 49 PM\nTo: Martin\, Ryan - ISD <ryan.martin@gdba.com<mailto:ryan.martin@
 gdba.com>>\nSubject: Follow-up\n\nHi Ryan —\n\nI wanted to see if you wa
 nted to have a call to answer any questions you may have and from what I
  understand\, Mike said you had a few things you wanted changed/correcte
 d.\n\nIf you would like to have a call\, when would be some good times?\
 n\nThanks.\n\nSteve Drohan CISM CRISC\nNCX Group\n909.720.7964 (Voice)\n
 888.481.6739 (Fax)\nsdrohan@ncxgroup.com<mailto:sdrohan@ncxgroup.com>\nh
 ttp://www.ncxgroup.com\n\nThis communication is confidential information
  that is intended only for the use of the addressee named above. If the 
 reader of this message is not the intended recipient or the employee/age
 nt responsible for delivering the message to the intended recipient\, pl
 ease note that any dissemination\, distribution or copying of this commu
 nication is strictly prohibited. If you received this communication in e
 rror\, please immediately notify us by telephone/fax and destroy the fac
 simile.\n
