 erence call bridge information:\n\nDial-In Number: (760) 569-7171\n\nPar
 ticipant Access: 117-521\n\n\n\nNicole Rosen\nInformation Security Direc
 tor\nInformation Security\nBANC OF CALIFORNIA\nOffice: 949-381-2860\nFax
 :    855-797-5393\nNicole.Rosen@bancofcal.com\n\nCONFIDENTIALITY NOTICE:
  This e-mail transmission\, and any documents\, files or previous e-mail
  messages attached to it\, may contain confidential information that is 
 legally privileged. If you are not the intended recipient\, or a person 
