DESCRIPTION:__________________\n\n\n\nGood Afternoon\,\n\n\n\nMy name is
  Daniel Gonzalez and I am the assigned analyst from NCXgroup for the Med
 ical Review Institute of America. I would like to schedule a phone confe
 rence to go over the bi-weekly report prepared for this reporting period
 . The meeting is currently scheduled for 3:00PM to 3:30PM MST on January
  23rd\, 2018. If this is a workable time frame please follow the instruc
 tions below\, otherwise we can collaborate on a more appropriate time.\n
 \n\n\nPlease follow the instructions below at the prescribed date and ti
 me:\n\nSubject: Conference 5504-8076\n\nAt the scheduled date and time p
 lease call – (303) 302-4929\nInternal participants please call - (555) 3
 76-4457\n\nIf prompted\, enter the following Conference ID: 5504-8076 fo
 llowed by # key.\n\n\n\nRespectfully sent\,\n\n\n\naniel A. Gonzalez\n\n
 Security Analyst I\n\n\n\n NCXgroup\n\n\n\n866-460-5583\n\n www.ncxgroup
 .com<http://www.ncxgroup.com>\n\n\n\nCONFIDENTIAL AND PROPRIETARY All in
 formation transmitted hereby is intended only for the use of the address
