BEGIN:VEVENT
CREATED:20200908T111150Z
DESCRIPTION:Guys\,\nI’m organizing this meeting to discuss our approach 
 to providing leak detections options to our customers.  Here are some qu
 estions we need to address:\n1)      Should we provide this as a managed
  service?\n2)      What does a partnership look like with a ILD vendor?\
 n3)      Should we just provide the solution and let the customer manage
  the information and reporting?\n\nAt this point I’ve reached out to the
  sales teams at both Vontu and NetWitness\, but I need to know what our 
 strategic direction will be before I schedule demo’s etc.\n\nbs\n
DTEND;TZID=America/Denver:20071025T103000
DTSTAMP:20250319T180209Z
