 f the timing doesn’t work\, please feel free to suggest alternate timing
 s this week.\n\nHi Mike\,\nHope you are doing well.\n\nAs you know Mpegl
 a has been acquired by DOLBY-Via and the new organization is trying to u
 nderstand the scope of services offered by various vendors. Some of serv
 ice looks to be overlapping from a high level.\n\nRegarding NCX\, we kno
